source -- a code-reading does not discharge this gate)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  $ grep -c 'STEP0C ADMISSIBILITY' spec356a-step0c-fixture.log
  7          <- as of PART I.  MUST be non-zero.  PASS
             <- SUPERSEDED AS A WHOLE-FILE COUNT: Part II raised it to 11.
                See Part II's copy of this block for the current value. Both
                readings are recorded rather than one overwritten, because the
